From: surya port <local>
Subject: [PATCH] surya: Adreno 618 bring-up (sweetgpu=1..9, sweetgpudelay), SCM/PAS signed zap and crypto-bandwidth RPMh votes; ported from the 8796 series 0224/0225 (source: mxtpasontop/ios-sweet gpu branch 0078-0098, no licence file)

--- a/bsd/dev/sweet_rpmh.c
